1
00:00:07,465 --> 00:00:09,843
Am I shaking because it hurts

2
00:00:09,843 --> 00:00:11,052
or...

3
00:00:18,309 --> 00:00:19,686
I don't know.

4
00:00:23,690 --> 00:00:24,983
Taking a break?

5
00:00:26,484 --> 00:00:27,110
Yes.

6
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:29,029
That performance earlier

7
00:00:29,029 --> 00:00:30,029
was good.

8
00:00:32,156 --> 00:00:33,156
What's the matter?

9
00:00:33,950 --> 00:00:35,118
Aren't you happy?

10
00:00:37,662 --> 00:00:38,747
It's nothing.

11
00:00:39,122 --> 00:00:40,122
But

12
00:00:40,957 --> 00:00:43,043
Seonghun is still

13
00:00:43,043 --> 00:00:44,127
more impressive.

14
00:00:45,211 --> 00:00:46,563
At this rate, the scholarship

15
00:00:46,564 --> 00:00:47,829
might not happen for you.

16
00:00:50,175 --> 00:00:51,718
Maybe if he hurts

17
00:00:51,718 --> 00:00:53,428
his hand like you...

18
00:00:56,347 --> 00:00:57,766
How's your hand, by the way?

19
00:01:00,351 --> 00:01:02,145
Push a little harder.

20
00:01:02,145 --> 00:01:02,923
Just don't take your anger

21
00:01:02,924 --> 00:01:03,924
out on the wrong things.

22
00:01:11,488 --> 00:01:13,156
I didn't feel anything.
